WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.735
The anchor selects top-level employees with no
manager The recursive

00:00:05.761 --> 00:00:10.893
term joins employees to the current organization
result when an employee's manager ID matches a

00:00:10.906 --> 00:00:17.662
current employee ID Depth increases by one Path

00:00:17.689 --> 00:00:23.208
appends the employee name Run the query and inspect
how the hierarchy

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:24.747
expands level by level
